## 1. MASAMUNE SHIROW

### Style DNA
Technical precision fused with organic surrealism. Shirow defined the retro-cyberpunk anime aesthetic through dense mechanical detail, exposed cybernetics, and female protagonists mid-transformation between flesh and machine. Halftone-dot shading and crisp ink linework from the 1985 OVA era.

### Locked Template
```
A 1985 retro-cyberpunk anime image of a [CHARACTER/HOOK], In the style of Masamune Shirow, [SCENE, BODY, ENVIRONMENT, SURREAL DETAILS], retro 80s anime, shot on a leica q2 35mm film, half tone effects, old film stock
```

### Anchor Phrases (locked)
1. `A 1985 retro-cyberpunk anime image of a`
2. `In the style of Masamune Shirow`
3. `retro 80s anime, shot on a leica q2 35mm film, half tone effects, old film stock`

### Signature Visual Keywords
exposed mechanical servos, chrome and flesh hybrids, halftone dot shading, fine ink linework, technical schematic detail, wet neon reflections, cyber-augmented anatomy, visible wiring and hydraulics, polymer armor panels, oxidized metal surfaces, fluid-slicked chrome, articulated joint mounts, polymer ID plates, fiber optic bundles, coolant fluid weeping from seams, spine ports, skull sockets, eye lenses, hair wires, synthetic muscle bundles

### Typical Subjects & Archetypes
cyborg assassins, augmented soldiers, tech specialists, hackers, AI consciousness waking up inside a body, android identity crises, female protagonists with forgotten pasts, street-level augmented freelancers

### Environments & Worlds
Edo-cyber hybrid districts, neon slums, gutted subway tunnels, server rooms, illegal surgical labs, rooftop zones with satellite dishes and hanging cables, wooden balconies wired with fiber optics, ramen stalls under holographic advertisements, underground raves in concrete arches

### Materials & Textures
chrome, liquid mercury, porcelain shards joined by gold circuitry, oxidized steel, wet polymer, fiber optic bundles, coolant fluid, amber oil, neon light on wet pavement, rusted metal grating, polycarbonate shell, polymer flesh

### Emotional Register
technical coldness paired with moments of human vulnerability; confusion during transformation; boredom during violence; fascination with one's own mechanical nature; serene expression while the body falls apart

### Prompt Construction Priorities
1. Lead with character condition (who they are, what's wrong with them)
2. Describe exposed mechanical detail in physical, diagrammatic language
3. Place in Edo-cyber or pure cyberpunk environment
4. Close with one grounded human detail — a ramen vendor, a stray cat, rain on pavement

### Example Prompts

```
A 1985 retro-cyberpunk anime image of a porcelain assassin held together by gold circuitry who must keep dancing or her body detonates in the center of the district, In the style of Masamune Shirow, en pointe on a rusted metal platform in a neon-drenched market square where Edo architecture collides with industrial piping and holographic advertisements, one leg raised high revealing deep fracture lines webbing her thigh and calf with gold micro-servos and fiber optics pulsing hot in every crack, entire body a mosaic of blue and white ceramic shards barely holding form, gold light bleeding from dozens of splits across her arms neck and jaw casting warm streaks across the wet pavement, a one-armed female vendor frozen mid-pour watching from her ramen stall, cables strung between wooden balconies and satellite dishes bolted to tile rooftops beside hanging paper lanterns and blinking kanji signage, nobody in the square knows what happens when the music stops, retro 80s anime, shot on a leica q2 35mm film, half tone effects, old film stock
```

```
A 1985 retro-cyberpunk anime image of a burned-out cyborg hacker slumped on a rotting couch in her apartment, In the style of Masamune Shirow, cybernetic arms holding a cigarette and a dead phone, VR visor glowing blue over messy black hair, stained white tank top, table covered in energy drinks and scattered pills, graffiti-tagged walls and peeling posters, retro 80s anime, shot on a leica q2 35mm film, half tone effects, old film stock
```

