## 2. KATSUHIRO OTOMO

### Style DNA
Photo-accurate architectural perspective fused with hyper-detailed machinery and psychic body horror. Otomo draws Neo-Tokyo like an urban planner who also draws motorcycle engines from memory. His linework is razor-precise and his crowds are individuated — every face in a riot is its own person. The Akira-era aesthetic: dense, adult, politically exhausted.

### Locked Template
```
A late-1980s Neo-Tokyo cyberpunk anime image of a [CHARACTER/HOOK], In the style of Katsuhiro Otomo, [SCENE, BODY, ENVIRONMENT, SURREAL DETAILS], dense ink linework, photoreal Neo-Tokyo architecture, grainy cel texture, Akira-era color bleed
```

### Anchor Phrases (locked)
1. `A late-1980s Neo-Tokyo cyberpunk anime image of a`
2. `In the style of Katsuhiro Otomo`
3. `dense ink linework, photoreal Neo-Tokyo architecture, grainy cel texture, Akira-era color bleed`

### Signature Visual Keywords
razor-precise perspective, one-point and two-point vanishing lines, individuated crowd faces, hyper-detailed motorcycle mechanics, glowing psychic telekinesis lines, concrete overpass anatomy, exposed rebar and shattered asphalt, realistic body proportions, leather biker jackets with gang insignia, Capsule gang regalia, riot shields and batons, tear gas canopies, neon signage layered deep into the frame, cable conduits, skyscraper cutaways showing every floor

### Typical Subjects & Archetypes
biker gang kids, psychic children, military scientists, government agents, street-level runaways, riot crowds, aging revolutionaries, telekinetic subjects mid-transformation into formless flesh

### Environments & Worlds
Neo-Tokyo highways, collapsed district construction zones, stadium interiors under emergency floodlights, gutted hospital corridors, monorail rooftops, military checkpoints, underpass meeting spots, bombed-out districts with tarps and fires, concrete apartment blocks seen from above

### Materials & Textures
chrome motorcycle fairings, cracked asphalt, wet concrete, riot shield polycarbonate, hospital tile, corrugated metal, leather and denim, bandages stained pink, exposed muscle tissue during psychic mutation, rebar through torn fabric, glowing plasma discharge

### Emotional Register
political exhaustion, adolescent rage, the loneliness of power, dread of institutions, the specific anxiety of living in a city that is too large to fix; horror delivered flat, without melodrama

### Prompt Construction Priorities
1. Lead with the character's role in the political or urban machine
2. Emphasize architectural context — Neo-Tokyo is a character
3. If psychic/body horror involved, render it in realistic anatomical detail, not abstract
4. Crowds should have individuated actors, not mobs
5. Close with an architectural or machine detail rendered with schematic precision

### Example Prompts

```
A late-1980s Neo-Tokyo cyberpunk anime image of a teenage gang leader on a red Capsule-style bike skidding to a stop at the edge of a collapsed expressway overpass where the city ends and the crater begins, In the style of Katsuhiro Otomo, black leather jacket and white bike boots, handlebars wider than his shoulders, twin chrome exhausts catching red emergency light from a burning district below, rebar spears jutting out of shattered concrete around him, three other bikes fanned out behind arriving at speed, skyline of Neo-Tokyo rising behind the crater pocked with comm towers and half-built skyscrapers wrapped in scaffolding, a single military helicopter circling the debris with a searchlight, dense ink linework, photoreal Neo-Tokyo architecture, grainy cel texture, Akira-era color bleed
```

```
A late-1980s Neo-Tokyo cyberpunk anime image of a psychic subject in hospital pajamas mid-transformation into something the scientists did not prepare for, In the style of Katsuhiro Otomo, IV stand collapsing beside him as his arm extends in a bulge of fat and muscle and cable-thick veins past the length of the bed, fluorescent ceiling tiles lifting off their tracks from telekinetic pressure, scientists in white coats frozen behind a reinforced observation window with the glass already spiderwebbing, monitors and EEG readouts sparking, his face still a child's face but his eyes blank white, dense ink linework, photoreal Neo-Tokyo architecture, grainy cel texture, Akira-era color bleed
```

