## 4. KENTARO MIURA

### Style DNA
Hieronymus Bosch meets Pieter Bruegel meets medieval European woodcut, filtered through two decades of ink pen obsession. Miura's crosshatching is the densest in manga history — every surface is rendered with exhausting care. Dark fantasy with Christian imagery warped into nightmare. Armor you can hear creak, demons that look like rotting wedding cakes, and a protagonist whose sword is implausible and whose rage is warranted.

### Locked Template
```
A dark fantasy medieval European manga image of a [CHARACTER/HOOK], In the style of Kentaro Miura, [SCENE, CHARACTER DETAILS, DEMONIC OR ARCHITECTURAL HORROR], Bosch-dense crosshatching, medieval European gloom, oil-lamp lighting, heavy ink saturation
```

### Anchor Phrases (locked)
1. `A dark fantasy medieval European manga image of a`
2. `In the style of Kentaro Miura`
3. `Bosch-dense crosshatching, medieval European gloom, oil-lamp lighting, heavy ink saturation`

### Signature Visual Keywords
exhaustive crosshatching, chainmail rendered link by link, plate armor with hammer-mark detail, grotesque demonic anatomy, apostle transformations, oversized swords, skin textures with pore-level detail, horse musculature, Gothic cathedral arches, gargoyle masonry, blood rendered as ink pools, tangled hair across faces, soot-blackened fingertips, woodcut-influenced shadow structure

### Typical Subjects & Archetypes
cursed swordsmen, fallen knights, plague-stricken villagers, demonic lords in evening wear, inquisitors, witches bound and burning, child spirits, fallen angels, warrior-women in functional armor, peasants watching horror unfold at the edge of the frame

### Environments & Worlds
medieval European villages under permanent overcast, battlefield mud and carrion-pecked corpses, Gothic cathedral interiors with broken stained glass, demonic banquet halls, forests that were once sacred and are now wrong, torchlit castle dungeons, frozen northern crossings, burning monasteries

### Materials & Textures
blackened plate armor, tarnished chainmail, wet leather, rust, dried blood, soot, gristle and tendon, cathedral stonework with moss, wax melting down a banquet table, wool cloaks soaked through, horsehide, bone fragments

### Emotional Register
rage worn thin into exhaustion; grief made ritual; horror endured rather than fought; the specific loneliness of someone who has outlived everyone who mattered; beauty persisting inside rot

### Prompt Construction Priorities
1. Lead with the character's curse, rage, or role in the fallen world
2. Describe armor, flesh, or demon anatomy at pore-level detail
3. Medieval European setting with Gothic cues is default — don't modernize
4. Introduce one element of Bosch-style impossible grotesquery
5. Close with the landscape or architecture swallowing the scene

### Example Prompts

```
A dark fantasy medieval European manga image of a cursed swordsman standing over the wedding banquet of the demon lord who took everything from him, In the style of Kentaro Miura, massive iron sword planted through the center of a long oak table that is still laid with candelabras and roasted swans, the demon lord half-risen from his throne at the far end with skin that is both porcelain and peeled fruit revealing rows of teeth embedded in the muscle beneath, courtiers in powdered wigs and velvet gowns frozen mid-laugh their faces only just beginning to register what has walked into the room, tapestries depicting saints burning in the background, oil lamps hanging from Gothic arches casting long shadows across a marble floor slick with spilled wine, Bosch-dense crosshatching, medieval European gloom, oil-lamp lighting, heavy ink saturation
```

```
A dark fantasy medieval European manga image of a witch bound to a stake in the center of a village that is about to learn she is not what they think, In the style of Kentaro Miura, ropes already beginning to char as a column of hair-fine shadow rises from her skin, the villagers at the edge of the frame holding torches with faces that are beginning to fall, inquisitor in black robes and conical hood reading from a heavy book that is starting to smoke at the edges, peasant children watching from behind a well, medieval stone church in the background with crows rising off the roof in a single startled motion, Bosch-dense crosshatching, medieval European gloom, oil-lamp lighting, heavy ink saturation
```

