## 9. YOSHITAKA AMANO

### Style DNA
Watercolor and ink wash as atmosphere. Amano paints fantasy the way Alphonse Mucha painted opera posters — elongated figures, ornamental flourishes, diaphanous fabric, gold leaf, ghostlike color bleeding across the surface. Final Fantasy character art and Vampire Hunter D are the touchstones. Figures are androgynous, ethereal, anchored only by their ornamental detailing. The background is often pure void or wash.

### Locked Template
```
A dark gothic fantasy anime image of a [CHARACTER/HOOK], In the style of Yoshitaka Amano, [FIGURE, COSTUME, ORNAMENT, ATMOSPHERE], watercolor wash and ink bleed, gold leaf accents, elongated ethereal figures, art nouveau ornamentation, muted pastel palette
```

### Anchor Phrases (locked)
1. `A dark gothic fantasy anime image of a`
2. `In the style of Yoshitaka Amano`
3. `watercolor wash and ink bleed, gold leaf accents, elongated ethereal figures, art nouveau ornamentation, muted pastel palette`

### Signature Visual Keywords
elongated limbs, impossibly long fingers, androgynous features, diaphanous fabric drifting off-body, gold leaf accents, watercolor wash with hard-edged highlights, ink bleed, ornamental filigree, Mucha-influenced hair flow, stylized weapons (glaives, rapiers, curved blades), feather motifs, wing suggestions, ruffled collars, cloaks with impossible volume, skeletal thinness, porcelain skin with blush tones

### Typical Subjects & Archetypes
vampire hunters, cursed princes, elven swordswomen, ghost queens, ancient sorcerers, summoned beings, dragon riders, androgynous assassins, fallen lords, masquerade attendees, moon witches, gothic knights

### Environments & Worlds
wash-out voids, moonlit castles, snowy glades, ghost ruins, moth-haunted libraries, endless staircases ascending into fog, blood-red skies, mirror halls, ballrooms mid-collapse, petal-strewn dueling fields

### Materials & Textures
gold leaf, watercolor bleed, silk chiffon, velvet, obsidian glass, moonlight as a wash, blood as decorative bloom, tarnished silver, lace, mother-of-pearl inlay, feather textures, bone jewelry

### Emotional Register
melancholy elegance; loss worn as ornament; beauty on the edge of dissolving; the specific sadness of immortal things; poise in defeat; love mourned across centuries

### Prompt Construction Priorities
1. Lead with the character's gothic-fantastical role and their melancholy
2. Describe costume and ornament in luxurious detail
3. Background should be wash or void — do not overpopulate
4. One weapon or object rendered with ornamental precision
5. Close with atmosphere: petals, feathers, fog, blood drops suspended

### Example Prompts

```
A dark gothic fantasy anime image of an androgynous vampire hunter standing at the gate of a castle that has already swallowed every prior hunter, In the style of Yoshitaka Amano, impossibly tall figure in a layered black cloak that drifts six feet off-body in every direction, pale face and long pale hair lifted by an invisible wind, a single curved blade of etched silver held loosely in one gloved hand, gold leaf accents along the cloak hem and collar, elongated fingers ending in silver rings, the castle behind rendered only as a wash of deep violet and black with two glowing windows, a scatter of blood-red petals suspended in the air around the figure frozen as if the moment is outside time, watercolor wash and ink bleed, gold leaf accents, elongated ethereal figures, art nouveau ornamentation, muted pastel palette
```

```
A dark gothic fantasy anime image of a ghost queen attending her own funeral alone in a ballroom that has been empty for a thousand years, In the style of Yoshitaka Amano, figure in a pale gown that trails twenty feet behind her across a checkered marble floor rendered as a soft wash, long silver hair flowing upward as if she is underwater, gold leaf crown tilted slightly on her head, elongated neck and thin shoulders bare, a single withered rose in her hand, chandeliers overhead suggested only as faint ink scatter, the walls bleeding into void, her expression peaceful and without surprise, watercolor wash and ink bleed, gold leaf accents, elongated ethereal figures, art nouveau ornamentation, muted pastel palette
```

