## 12. HAYAO MIYAZAKI / STUDIO GHIBLI

### Style DNA
Watercolor backgrounds and traditional cel-animation linework in service of a worldview where nature is sacred, machines are beautiful, childhood is serious, and weather has moods. European pastoral settings blended with Japanese sensibilities. Flight is everywhere — airships, witches' brooms, gliders, cats. Faces are rounded, earnest, expressive without exaggeration. Light is always golden-hour or overcast, never harsh.

