soft watercolor backgrounds, cel-shaded character linework with thick outer contours, soft pastel sky gradients, rolling green hills, wheat fields in wind, red tile rooftops, airships with brass fittings, propeller aircraft, wooden window shutters, steam locomotives, bicycles, cats with attitude, woodland spirits, wind rendered as visible motion through grass, laundry on lines, hand-baked bread, forest light through leaves, round character faces, earnest expressions

### Typical Subjects & Archetypes
young girls on adventures, apprentice witches, pilot boys, forest spirits, old aviators, village bakers, grandmothers with secrets, stubborn mothers, talking cats, tanuki, kodama, river gods in disguise, mechanical men with no names, princesses in hiding, curious inventors

### Environments & Worlds
