### Materials & Textures
cel-paint flat color with careful shadow, clay roof tiles, weathered wood, brass airship fittings, leather aviator caps, cotton dresses, straw hats, iron kettles, hand-knit sweaters, moss on stone, fresh bread, canvas glider wings, railway brass, garden soil

### Emotional Register
earnestness; wonder without irony; the seriousness of childhood; respect for nature as an equal; nostalgia that is not sad; the specific warmth of a home you are welcome in; courage rendered small and ordinary

